OL,3,GNEWSAA busy year in Manx waters for
OL,4,Asharks and jellyfish
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has been a bumper year for marine
OL,7,Flife around the Isle of Man coast.
OL,9,F"It's been the best year for spotting
OL,10,Fsharks in decades," says fisherman and
OL,11,Ftour guide, Nicky Lewis.
OL,13,FTwo Bottlenose dolphins, nicknamed
OL,14,FMoonlight and Starlight, have also been
OL,15,Fputting on a regular show for
OL,16,Fpassengers off Peel.
OL,18,FAnd this year has seen a lots of seals,
OL,19,Fporpoises and, unfortunately, huge
OL,20,Fswarms of jellyfish - which are not so
OL,21,Fpopular!
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
